WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.553 --> 00:00:15.274
found Mongdol one afternoon.

2
00:00:17.454 --> 00:00:19.535
Mongdol had just finished his work.

3
00:00:26.438 --> 00:00:26.998
to play?"

4
00:00:27.298 --> 00:00:28.139
Gildong said.

5
00:00:28.159 --> 00:00:32.192
"Sure," Mongdol said.

6
00:00:34.853 --> 00:00:36.814
They went out with a wooden board.

7
00:00:40.114 --> 00:00:41.675
Gildong stood on one end.

8
00:00:43.275 --> 00:00:45.476
Mongdol was about to jump on the other.

9
00:00:46.716 --> 00:00:49.537
Just then Inhyun stomped over.

10
00:00:49.557 --> 00:00:53.818
"Out of my way," he growled, shoving Gildong away.

11
00:00:55.559 --> 00:00:58.219
He looked at Mongdol on the other side of the board.

12
00:00:58.239 --> 00:01:00.240
"Jump, servant!"

13
00:01:03.116 --> 00:01:05.417
"Tee-hee-hee. Yes, young master."

14
00:01:06.738 --> 00:01:09.039
Mongdol leaped high into the air.

15
00:01:09.779 --> 00:01:13.841
Then—bam! He slammed down on the board.

16
00:01:15.181 --> 00:01:18.302
Inhyun flew straight up into the tree branches.

17
00:01:18.322 --> 00:01:24.965
"Ahh!" "Master Inhyun, please come down," Mongdol said.

18
00:01:24.985 --> 00:01:29.587
"Tee-hee-hee." Inhyun kicked his legs wildly.

19
00:01:30.828 --> 00:01:35.617
Crack! A branch broke, and Inhyun tumbled out of the tree.

20
00:01:35.637 --> 00:01:38.418
"My leg!"

21
00:01:38.818 --> 00:01:40.258
he screamed in pain.

22
00:01:41.639 --> 00:01:43.339
Lady Yoo rushed out.

23
00:01:43.359 --> 00:01:47.120
"You're in big trouble!"

24
00:01:47.640 --> 00:01:49.141
she snapped at Gildong.

25
00:01:56.703 --> 00:01:59.964
Later Gildong crept outside Inhyun's room.

26
00:02:01.048 --> 00:02:02.809
He peered between the doors.

27
00:02:02.829 --> 00:02:09.054
"Husband, look at our precious son's leg," Lady Yoo said.

28
00:02:09.074 --> 00:02:12.797
"It's Gildong's fault," Inhyun said.

29
00:02:12.817 --> 00:02:16.239
"He and that dumb servant tried to kill me."

30
00:02:17.920 --> 00:02:19.281
Lord Hong frowned.

31
00:02:19.301 --> 00:02:22.544
"That doesn't sound like Gildong."

32
00:02:22.564 --> 00:02:25.826
"Phew," Gildong thought.

33
00:02:25.846 --> 00:02:27.968
"Lord Hong trusts me at least."

34
00:02:29.160 --> 00:02:31.882
He watched Lord Hong pace back and forth.

35
00:02:34.464 --> 00:02:35.765
"But it's true, Father!

36
00:02:36.166 --> 00:02:36.986
It's true!"

37
00:02:37.447 --> 00:02:38.227
Inhyun said.

38
00:02:38.247 --> 00:02:41.490
"Gildong and that servant are trouble.

39
00:02:42.231 --> 00:02:44.893
You must punish them," Lady Yoo said.

40
00:02:46.474 --> 00:02:47.675
Lord Hong sighed.

41
00:02:47.695 --> 00:02:51.838
"Fine. I'll send Mongdol away."

42
00:02:51.858 --> 00:02:56.542
"My only friend," Gildong thought.

43
00:02:57.463 --> 00:02:58.424
His heart sank.

44
00:03:02.060 --> 00:03:04.861
He hurried to the servants' quarters to warn Mongdol.

45
00:03:05.762 --> 00:03:07.182
But Mongdol wasn't there.

46
00:03:08.343 --> 00:03:09.983
Gildong looked everywhere.

47
00:03:16.026 --> 00:03:17.687
A laugh came from the gate.

48
00:03:18.847 --> 00:03:21.448
"Mongdol!" Gildong ran over.

49
00:03:21.468 --> 00:03:23.729
"Did you hear the news?"

50
00:03:23.749 --> 00:03:26.090
"I did not hear.

51
00:03:27.271 --> 00:03:28.471
Yet I already know."

52
00:03:30.152 --> 00:03:32.605
"Huh?" Gildong was confused.

53
00:03:33.645 --> 00:03:36.466
But Mongdol often said confusing things.

54
00:03:37.647 --> 00:03:39.067
Gildong hung his head.

55
00:03:39.087 --> 00:03:41.488
"I guess this is good-bye."

56
00:03:43.189 --> 00:03:44.429
Mongdol grinned.

57
00:03:44.449 --> 00:03:47.531
"No. We'll meet again soon.

58
00:03:47.951 --> 00:03:54.213
Tee-hee-hee." He went through the gate and disappeared down the road.

59
00:03:58.635 --> 00:04:00.756
all alone again," Gildong thought.

60
00:04:02.252 --> 00:04:04.093
He looked down and kicked a stone.

61
00:04:06.775 --> 00:04:08.096
A glimmer caught his eye.

62
00:04:08.116 --> 00:04:09.697
"What's this?"

63
00:04:12.118 --> 00:04:16.441
Gildong saw a thin silver thread, like a spider's web.

64
00:04:19.203 --> 00:04:22.705
The long thread led off in the direction that Mongdol went.

65
00:04:25.367 --> 00:04:27.028
Gildong began to follow it.

66
00:04:31.104 --> 00:04:33.366
The thread seemed to go on forever.

67
00:04:35.608 --> 00:04:37.710
Gildong ran fast and far.

68
00:04:41.393 --> 00:04:45.016
He leaped on tree branches and jumped over a stream.

69
00:04:53.683 --> 00:04:57.226
Eventually he found himself high in the mountains.

70
00:04:58.727 --> 00:05:01.003
Suddenly the thread disappeared.

71
00:05:01.023 --> 00:05:04.771
"How strange," Gildong thought.

72
00:05:04.791 --> 00:05:06.915
"I wonder what that was."
